The '''Altano Trade Route''' was a [[hyperspace route]].<ref name="Battlefront II">''[[Star Wars Battlefront II]]''</ref> At some point between [[4 ABY|4]] and [[5 ABY]],<ref name="Date">''[[Star Wars Battlefront II]]'' shows [[Han Solo]]'s [[Skirmish on Takodana|visit]] to [[Takodana]] taking place between the [[Battle of Endor]] and the [[Battle of Jakku]], which ''[[Star Wars: Galactic Atlas]]'' dates to [[4 ABY]] and [[5 ABY]], respectively.</ref> a [[human]] and a [[Weequay]] criminal made plans to ambush [[Galactic Empire|Imperial]] [[convoy]]s at a point along the trade route while they were drinking at the [[Takodana Castle|castle]] of the [[pirate]] [[Maz Kanata]] on the [[planet]] [[Takodana]].<ref name="Battlefront II" />

